Package: FastTail
Title: Fast Inference on Bivariate Tail Dependence and Tail Asymmetry Using Neural Bayes Estimators
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Lei", "Hua", email = "larry.lei.hua@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast inference of various tail dependence and tail asymmetry patterns
    for bivariate copulas, covering the GGEE and PPPP copulas. Pre-trained neural
    Bayes estimators are bundled with the package; inference requires only base R.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
